# A schematic Jalsavrah (Pyramid Plunder) room for replays. Not the real map.
#
# Facts:
#  - the pyramid is map region 7749 (RuneLite's PyramidPlunderPlugin.PYRAMID_PLUNDER_REGION); the player and urns stand in it
#  - rooms open at 21, 31, 41 ... 91 Thieving; a run lasts five minutes (500 ticks); each room's
#    spear trap is disarmed first (oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Pyramid_Plunder)
#  - varbits NTK_ROOM_NUMBER, NTK_PLAYER_TIMER_COUNT (ticks into the run), NTK_TRAP_ACTIVE and one
#    NTK_URNn_STATE per urn are RuneLite's names (net.runelite.api.gameval.VarbitID)
# Schematic: each urn object NTK_URN_TYPE1_MULTI_n changes with NTK_URNn_STATE, showing a closed
# urn at 0 and an open one at 1. The real state numbering is the game's and is not modelled.

scene 1920 4416
at 1950 4450

multiloc NTK_URN_TYPE1_MULTI_1 NTK_URN1_STATE NTK_URN1_CLOSED NTK_URN1_OPEN
multiloc NTK_URN_TYPE1_MULTI_2 NTK_URN2_STATE NTK_URN1_CLOSED NTK_URN1_OPEN
multiloc NTK_URN_TYPE1_MULTI_3 NTK_URN3_STATE NTK_URN1_CLOSED NTK_URN1_OPEN
multiloc NTK_URN_TYPE1_MULTI_4 NTK_URN4_STATE NTK_URN1_CLOSED NTK_URN1_OPEN
multiloc NTK_URN_TYPE1_MULTI_5 NTK_URN5_STATE NTK_URN1_CLOSED NTK_URN1_OPEN
object NTK_URN_TYPE1_MULTI_1 1945 4455 as urn1
object NTK_URN_TYPE1_MULTI_2 1947 4455 as urn2
object NTK_URN_TYPE1_MULTI_3 1949 4455 as urn3
object NTK_URN_TYPE1_MULTI_4 1951 4455 as urn4
object NTK_URN_TYPE1_MULTI_5 1953 4455 as urn5

# What the plaque on screen says.
watch figure plaque.shown.figure
watch step plaque.shown.step
watch detail plaque.shown.detail
